      "text": "That’s bull. Creole? No. The main Louisiana version is a very old original form of French that the French Acadians brought with them when they were expelled from Grand Pre’ in Nova Scotia Canada. The blacks formulated their own version. Creole is a racial mix of black and Cajun.",
