      "text": "\"I'm from Poland. Met a damn good oil field hand from down your way one time — I worked the patch too. I sing Elvis for a livin' — you know he done 'Polk Salad Annie,' all about Louisiana. I like that hot, wet, swampy mess y'all got goin' on. But ain't nothin' bigger than Jesus — He run my life, for real. Poland's pullin' for y'all, cher.\"",
